# OpenAxis — Cursor Rules
#
# Scoped rules (auto-loaded per file type) are in .cursor/rules/:
#   core.mdc      — architecture rules (always loaded)
#   backend.mdc   — Python/FastAPI rules (packages/**/*.py)
#   frontend.mdc  — React/Vite/Tailwind rules (frontend/**/*.{jsx,tsx,...})
#   security.mdc  — security rules (always loaded)
#
# Full spec: docs/openaxis-build-spec.md → docs/spec/
